-- title:
--   An r-unit of an Eichler order with reduced norm r
-- statement:
--   Fix rationals $a,b$ and a prime $q$ (carried as a `Fact` instance) with $q \neq 2$, and assume `IsDefiniteRamifiedExactlyAt a b q`: $a < 0$, $b < 0$, and for every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ the completed algebra $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b] \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathbb{Q}_v$ has all its nonzero elements invertible exactly when $q \in v$. Let $R$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ and $N$ a natural number with `IsEichlerOrder R N`, i.e. $R = \Lambda_1 \cap \Lambda_2$ for two orders $\Lambda_1,\Lambda_2$ each maximal among the orders containing it, the relative index of the additive group of $R$ in that of $\Lambda_1$ being $N$. Let $r$ be a further prime (again a `Fact` instance) with $r \neq q$, and let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ whose ideal contains the image of $r$. Then there is a unit $\gamma$ of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ lying in `CosetGraph.awayUnits R v`, that is, for every height-one prime $w \neq v$ the image of $\gamma$ in $(\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b] \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathbb{Q}_w)^{\times}$ under the map induced by $z \mapsto z \otimes 1$ lies in the subgroup generated by the set of units $u$ with both $u$ and $u^{-1}$ in the local box of $R$ at $w$, and such that $\mathrm{nrd}(\gamma) = \gamma_{\mathrm{re}}^2 - a\gamma_{\mathrm{imI}}^2 - b\gamma_{\mathrm{imJ}}^2 + ab\,\gamma_{\mathrm{imK}}^2$ equals $r$.
--
--   This is the form of Eichler's norm theorem needed for the $r$-arithmetic group of an Eichler order in a definite quaternion algebra ramified exactly at $q$: the reduced norm of the group of units that are local units away from the place $v$ above $r$ attains the value $r$, so that these units move between the two vertex classes of the Bruhat–Tits tree at $v$. It feeds the construction of the Čerednik–Drinfeld interchange data and of Hecke towers of Shimura curve models, in [`CerednikDrinfeld.exists_shimuraCurveModel_heckeTower_and_interchangeData_pair_of_six_mul_dvd_of_neZero`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.exists_shimuraCurveModel_heckeTower_and_interchangeData_pair_of_six_mul_dvd_of_neZero) and [`CerednikDrinfeld.exists_units_finiteIdele_levelHeckeUSet_meetOrder_eq_tmul_one_of_dvd`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.exists_units_finiteIdele_levelHeckeUSet_meetOrder_eq_tmul_one_of_dvd).
